return ['domain'=>'tranzly','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'tranzly','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-26T14:03:23+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-26T14:03:23+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Tranzly'=>'Tranzly','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/tranzly'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/tranzly','Multilingual WordPress, one post per language: linked translations of posts, pages, categories, media text, widgets and the site title, with your old Tranzly translations imported.'=>'多语言 WordPress，每种语言对应一篇文章：文章、页面、分类、媒体文本、小部件和网站标题的链接翻译，并已导入您原有的 Tranzly 翻译。','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','AI providers'=>'AI 提供商','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'ChatGPT 的创造者。一款表现全面的优秀工具。','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Claude 的创造者。擅长写作与严谨推理。','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Google 的 Gemini 模型。快速且经济实惠。','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'一家拥有快速且经济实惠模型的欧洲人工智能公司。','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'擅长写作和代码的高性价比模型。','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'一个密钥即可调用来自多家不同提供商的模型。','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'任何像 OpenAI 的 API 一样运行的服务，包括在您自己的计算机或服务器上运行的模型。','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'通用（当未设置更具体的内容时使用）','Writing and rewriting'=>'编写和重写','Translation'=>'翻译','Code and CSS'=>'代码和 CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'抱歉，您无权访问此页面。','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'这些设置由使用它们的每个插件共享：%s。','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'您的密钥已在此网站的数据库中加密，且只会发送至您选择的服务提供商——绝不会发送给我们。','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'第 1 步（共 2 步）：选择 AI 提供商','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'您自备密钥，因此您直接向服务商支付实际使用的费用。拿不准？以下任意一种都可以，您以后还可以添加更多。','Next'=>'下一步','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'第 2 步，共 2 步：连接 %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'请输入您的 OpenAI 兼容服务的地址，以 /v1 结尾。仅当服务要求时才需要密钥。','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'打开 %s 并登录（或创建一个免费账户）。','the %s API keys page'=>'%s API 密钥页面','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'创建一个新密钥并复制它。','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'将其粘贴在下方，然后点击“保存并测试”。我们会发送一个微小的请求以检查其是否正常工作。','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'大多数提供商需要在账户中有少许余额后，密钥才能生效：%s。','add credit'=>'添加额度','← Choose a different provider'=>'← 选择其他服务商','Address'=>'地址','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'已保存的密钥以……%s结尾 — 请粘贴新密钥以替换它','Key (optional)'=>'密钥（可选）','API key'=>'API 密钥','Save and test'=>'保存并测试','Providers'=>'服务商','Provider'=>'服务商','Status'=>'状态','Key'=>'密钥','Get a key'=>'获取密钥','Test'=>'测试','Remove'=>'移除','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'保存自较新版本的插件：请更新此插件，或重新输入密钥。','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'已保存的密钥无法再打开（网站的安全密钥已更改）。请重新输入。','Not connected'=>'未连接','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'已连接 — 上次测试通过 %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'上一次测试失败：%s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'已连接 — 尚未测试','Which model to use'=>'使用哪个模型','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ 表示我们针对该任务的推荐。此列表包含您的密钥可以使用的所有模型，由提供商实时读取。','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— 建议服务商使用 —','Save models'=>'保存模型','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'从提供商处刷新模型列表','best quality'=>'最高品质','lowest cost'=>'最低费用','fastest'=>'最快','Add a model yourself'=>'自行添加模型','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'今天发布了新模型？输入其准确名称即可直接使用。','Model name'=>'模型名称','Add model'=>'添加模型','Recommended models list'=>'推荐模型列表','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'无法验证推荐模型列表，因此未显示任何推荐。请重新安装插件，或在下方开启每日更新。','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'正在使用的列表发布于 %s。每次插件更新都会带来一个新的列表。','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'每天也请查看一次 Zinn Digital® 以获取更新的列表。','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'仅发送纯下载请求：不包含密钥、网站地址，也没有关于您内容的任何信息。该列表经过签名，签名检查未通过的列表将被忽略。','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'最后检查于 %1$s：%2$s。','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'保存并在开启时立即检查','a newer list was installed'=>'已安装更新的列表','already up to date'=>'已经是最新版本','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'下载未能通过签名检查，已被忽略','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'无法连接到 Zinn Digital®；当前列表将继续使用','turned off'=>'已关闭','Open'=>'打开','Check their status page'=>'查看他们的状态页面','Open your billing page'=>'打开您的账单页面','Open your API keys page'=>'打开您的 API 密钥页面','Open the AI settings'=>'打开 AI 设置','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'很抱歉，您没有权限执行此操作。','Unknown provider.'=>'未知服务商。','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'请输入您的服务地址，例如 http://localhost:11434/v1。','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'这看起来不像 API 密钥。请重新复制，不要包含空格。','Paste your API key first.'=>'请先粘贴您的API密钥。','Key removed.'=>'密钥已移除。','Models saved.'=>'模型已保存。','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'请输入模型的准确名称，例如照供应商文档中所写的那样。','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'已添加 %s。请在“使用哪个模型”下进行选择。','Model removed.'=>'模型已移除。','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'每日更新已关闭。将使用插件自带的列表。','Checked: %s.'=>'已选中：%s。','Model lists refreshed.'=>'模型列表已刷新。','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'您的 AI 密钥已被某个插件的较新版本保存。请更新此插件，或在 AI 设置中重新输入密钥。','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'您保存的 AI 密钥已无法打开（该网站的安全密钥已更改）。请在 AI 设置中重新输入。','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI 尚未设置。请在 AI 设置中添加 AI 提供商的密钥。','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'未为此任务选择模型。请在 AI 设置中选择一个。','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'此版本的插件不支持该 AI 提供商。','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'此网站无法连接到您的 AI 服务。请检查该服务是否正在运行，以及您的网络服务器是否能够访问其地址（托管网站无法访问您自己计算机上的服务）。','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'此网站无法访问 %s。请检查其状态页面；如果服务器运行正常，则可能是您的主机屏蔽了外发连接，或者地址输入错误。','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s 表示您的账户已无可用额度或配额。请在其账户中添加额度或提高限制，然后重试。','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s 未接受您的密钥。它可能输入错误、已被吊销或已过期。请创建一个新密钥并将其粘贴在此处。','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s 拒绝了针对您的密钥的此请求。该密钥可能无法访问此模型或功能，或者您的账户需要验证。','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'您的密钥无法通过 %2$s 使用模型 "%1$s"。请在 AI 设置中选择另一个模型。','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'您的 %2$s 方案不包含模型 "%1$s"。请在 AI 设置中选择其他模型，或通过他们升级您的方案。','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s 正在限制您的密钥发送请求的速度。请稍候一分钟再试，或者提高您与他们的速率限制。','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s 目前遇到问题（对方服务器出现故障或过载）。您的设置没有问题。请稍后重试。','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'AI 请求因未知原因失败。请重试；如果问题仍然存在，请将以下详细信息提供给客服支持。','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'AI 提供商返回了此插件无法读取的格式。请重试；如果问题持续存在，请选择其他模型或联系支持人员。','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'自定义（兼容 OpenAI）','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'请先为该服务商保存一个密钥。','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'您的密钥有效，但提供商未列出可用的文本模型。请在下方自行添加模型。','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'已连接：%1$s 使用 %2$s 接听。您的人工智能功能已准备就绪。','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'您的用户角色不允许在本网站上使用人工智能。请联系管理员。','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'此网站已达到每月的 AI 消费限额。管理员可以在 AI 设置中提高限额。','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'本网站已达到每月的 AI 请求额度上限。管理员可以在 AI 设置中提高此额度。','Usage and cost'=>'使用量与费用','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'日志、限制和角色权限适用于通过以下方式使用的 AI：%s。','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'费用为大致估算，根据公开价格计算；没有已知价格的型号计为零。','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'本月：%1$s 个请求，约占 %2$s。','When'=>'当','Who'=>'谁','Used for'=>'用于','Model'=>'模型','Tokens in / out'=>'输入 / 输出','About'=>'关于','Result'=>'结果','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'尚未发起任何 AI 请求。','Done'=>'已完成','Limits and permissions'=>'限制与权限','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'每月支出限额（US dollars）','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'留空则表示不设限制。当大致费用达到该限额时，AI将在这个月的剩余时间内停止服务。','Monthly request limit'=>'每月请求数限制','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'留空则表示无限制。','Who may use AI'=>'谁可以使用人工智能','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'不勾选则允许所有能够使用该插件功能的人使用人工智能。管理员始终可以使用。','Save limits and permissions'=>'保存限制和权限','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'限制和权限已保存。','That language is not one of this site\'s languages.'=>'该语言不是本网站的语言之一。','A translation must be the same kind of content as the original.'=>'翻译必须与原文的内容类型保持一致。','Choose one of the site\'s other languages.'=>'选择该网站的其他语言之一。','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'此插件副本中缺少管理屏幕的脚本。请从发布的程序包中重新安装。','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'此屏幕需要 JavaScript。','Choose a language'=>'选择语言','Upgrade'=>'升级','Pricing'=>'价格','Start Trial'=>'开始试用','Account'=>'账户','Contact Us'=>'联系我们','Affiliation'=>'隶属关系','the kind of softwarePlugin'=>'插件','greetingHey %s,'=>'您好，%s，','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'选择接收有关安全与功能更新、教育内容和偶尔优惠的电子邮件通知，并共享一些基本的 WordPress 环境信息。这将帮助我们使 %s 与您的网站更兼容，并更好地满足您的需求。','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'选择接收电子邮件通知，以获取安全与功能更新、教育内容和不定期优惠，并分享一些基本的 WordPress 环境信息。','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'如果您跳过这一步也没关系！%1$s 仍能正常运行。','Allow & Continue'=>'允许并继续','verbSkip'=>'跳过','Skipping, please wait'=>'正在跳过，请稍候','Continue'=>'继续','Please wait'=>'请稍候','as activating pluginActivating'=>'正在激活','This will allow %s to'=>'这允许 %s','Privacy Policy'=>'隐私政策','Terms of Service'=>'服务条款','License Agreement'=>'许可协议','Have a license key?'=>'我有许可证密钥？','Activate License'=>'激活许可证','View Basic Profile Info'=>'查看基本个人资料信息','Your WordPress user\'s: first & last name, and email address'=>'您的 WordPress 用户的名字、姓氏和电子邮箱地址','View Basic Website Info'=>'查看基本网站信息','Homepage URL & title, WP & PHP versions, and site language'=>'主页网址和标题、WP 及 PHP 版本以及网站语言','View Basic %s Info'=>'查看基本 %s 信息','Current %s & SDK versions, and if active or uninstalled'=>'当前 %s 及 SDK 版本，以及是否处于活跃或已卸载状态','Newsletter'=>'通讯稿','Updates, announcements, marketing, no spam'=>'更新、公告、营销，绝无垃圾邮件','View Diagnostic Info'=>'查看诊断信息','WordPress & PHP versions, site language & title'=>'WordPress 和 PHP 版本、网站语言与标题','View Plugins & Themes List'=>'查看插件和主题列表','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'名称、缩略名、版本以及是否处于激活状态','optional'=>'可选','Never miss an important update'=>'不错过任何重要更新','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'我们引入此可选订阅功能，旨在确保您不会错过任何重要的更新，并帮助我们使 %s 与您的网站更加兼容，更好地满足您的需求。','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'感谢您更新至 %1$s v%2$s！','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'前缀必须为 1 到 8 个小写字母或数字，以字母开头，且不能与插件名称相同。','"%s" is not a language code. Use a WordPress locale such as fr_FR or de_DE.'=>'"%s" 不是语言代码。请使用 WordPress 区域设置，例如 fr_FR 或 de_DE。','List at least one language.'=>'请列出至少一种语言。','You are not allowed to translate this item.'=>'您无权翻译此项目。','This item already has a version in that language.'=>'该语言中已经存在此项目的一个版本。','That translation engine is not available on this site.'=>'此网站上无法使用该翻译引擎。','Different engines per language, automatic fallback and spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'不同语言使用不同翻译引擎、自动回退机制以及消费限额是 Tranzly Pro 功能。','Each language must be one of the site\'s languages, with an available engine.'=>'每种语言必须是该网站的语言之一，并且必须配备可用的引擎。','The fallback list may only name available engines.'=>'备用列表只能包含可用的引擎。','A monthly cap is an amount in US dollars, zero or more, for an available engine.'=>'可用引擎的每月上限是可用引擎的一个 US 元金额，可以为零或大于零。','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features. The do-not-translate list is free.'=>'针对每种语言的偏好翻译和语气功能属于 Tranzly Pro 专业版功能。禁止翻译列表则是免费的。','Glossary entries must be grouped by one of the site\'s languages.'=>'术语表条目必须按网站的一种语言进行分组。','Tone is set per site language: formality default, more or less, plus optional instructions.'=>'语气按网站语言设置：默认正式程度（程度略有不同），外加可选指令。','The value for %s is not one of the allowed choices.'=>'%s 的值不在允许的选择范围内。','The background queue is not available on this site.'=>'此网站当前无法使用后台队列。','A translation job runs as the person who starts it, so a user must be signed in.'=>'翻译作业将以启动它的用户的身份运行，因此用户必须处于登录状态。','There is nothing you are allowed to translate in that selection.'=>'选定的内容中没有任何您可以翻译的文本。','That item is not part of a translation job.'=>'该项目不属于任何翻译任务。','You are not allowed to change that translation.'=>'您无权更改该翻译。','This item\'s group already has a %1$s version (#%2$d).'=>'此项目的分组已存在一个 %1$s 版本 (#%2$d)。','An item cannot be its own translation.'=>'一项不能是其自身的翻译。','That item is already a translation of something else. Unlink it first.'=>'该项目已经是其他内容的翻译。请先取消链接。','The translation link could not be saved.'=>'无法保存翻译链接。','That text cannot be translated here.'=>'无法在此处翻译该文本。','That media text cannot be translated here.'=>'该媒体文本无法在此处翻译。','A translation can be published or kept as a draft.'=>'翻译可以发布或保留为草稿。','You are not allowed to publish this kind of content.'=>'您无权发布此类内容。','This item is already written in that language.'=>'该项目已经使用该语言编写。','This translation was edited by a person (or imported), so it is protected. Unlock it to translate it again.'=>'此翻译由人工编辑（或导入），因此已被保护。解锁后方可重新翻译。','No translation engine is set up yet. Add a key for one in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'尚未设置翻译引擎。请在 Tranzly → 引擎中添加一个密钥。','That translation engine is not set up yet: add its key first.'=>'该翻译引擎尚未配置：请先添加其密钥。','The same text is being translated by another job right now; this item will use that answer.'=>'另一个翻译任务目前正在翻译相同的文本；此项目将使用该翻译结果。','No translation engine could take this item.'=>'没有任何翻译引擎可以处理此项。','The engine did not return a translation for every part of this item. Nothing was changed.'=>'引擎未返回此项目各个部分的翻译。未作任何更改。','AI model'=>'AI 模型','AI model (%1$s %2$s)'=>'AI 模型 (%1$s %2$s)','%s is having problems right now. Try again shortly, or use another engine.'=>'%s 当前遇到问题。请稍后重试，或使用其他引擎。','Your site could not reach %s. Check that it can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'您的网站无法连接到 %s。请检查其是否能够建立传出连接，然后重试。','%s did not accept your API key. Check the key in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'%s 未接受您的 API 密钥。请检查 Tranzly → Engines 中的密钥。','Your %s account has used up its quota or balance. Top it up with them, or use another engine.'=>'您的 %s 账户已用完配额或余额。请通过他们进行充值，或使用其他引擎。','%s asked us to slow down. It will be tried again automatically.'=>'%s 请求我们降低速度。系统将自动重试。','This text is too long for %s in one go. Split the content, or use another engine.'=>'这段文本对于 %s 来说一次性过长。请拆分内容，或使用其他引擎。','%s refused to translate this content. Try another engine, or translate it by hand.'=>'%s 拒绝翻译此内容。请尝试其他引擎，或手动进行翻译。','%s does not translate this language. Choose another engine for it.'=>'%s 不支持此语言的翻译。请为其选择其他引擎。','This month\'s spending cap for %s is reached, so nothing more was sent to it. Raise the cap in Tranzly → Engines, or wait until next month.'=>'已达到 %s 本月的消费上限，因此未再向其发送任何内容。请在 Tranzly → Engines 中提高上限，或等待下个月。','The translation with %s failed for a reason Tranzly could not identify. The details are below.'=>'使用 %s 进行的翻译失败，原因不明，Tranzly 无法识别。详细信息如下。','An engine id must be lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'搜索引擎ID必须由小写字母、数字和连字符组成。','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'由 Zinn Digital® Ltd 首席执行官 Neil Lock 构建','Version %s'=>'版本 %s','Tranzly website'=>'Tranzly 网站','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Zinn Digital® 网站','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'查看 Pro 方案和价格','Languages'=>'语言','The first language is the one your content is written in. Visitors switch with the language switcher block.'=>'首选语言即为您内容编写所用的语言。访客可以使用语言切换器区块进行切换。','(default)'=>'(默认)','Locale code'=>'区域代码','For example fr_FR'=>'例如 fr_FR','Name (optional)'=>'名称（可选）','For example Français'=>'例如 Français','Add language'=>'添加语言','Front-end output'=>'前端输出','Class name prefix'=>'类名前缀','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'插件在您的页面上输出的每个类名都以此前缀开头，这样页面就不会暴露是哪个插件构建的。1 到 8 个小写字母或数字，且必须以字母开头。','Beta updates'=>'Beta 更新','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'本网站接收测试版更新。','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'本网站仅接收稳定版本。','Change this on the Account page'=>'请在“账户”页面上更改此设置','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'测试版提供给已连接至其账户的授权 Pro 安装版。连接后，您可以从“账户”页面加入。','Save settings'=>'保存设置','First engine that is set up'=>'第一个配置的引擎','Key saved. It is stored encrypted and never shown again.'=>'密钥已保存。系统会将其加密存储，且绝不会再次显示。','Engine settings saved.'=>'引擎设置已保存。','Glossary saved.'=>'已保存词汇表。','Your keys'=>'您的密钥','Tranzly calls the translation services with your own account. Keys are stored encrypted in your database and are only ever sent to the service they belong to. AI model keys are set in the AI settings.'=>'Tranzly 使用您自己的账户调用翻译服务。密钥在数据库中以加密方式存储，且仅发送至其所属的服务。AI 模型密钥在 AI 设置中进行配置。','%s API key'=>'%s API 密钥','Saved: %s. Enter a new key to replace it, or save an empty field to remove it.'=>'已保存：%s。请输入新密钥进行替换，或保存空字段以将其删除。','No key saved.'=>'未保存密钥。','Azure region (leave empty for a global resource)'=>'Azure 区域（留空则表示全局资源）','Save key'=>'保存密钥','Check my DeepL usage'=>'检查我的 DeepL 使用情况','%1$s of %2$s characters used this billing period.'=>'本计费周期已使用 %1$s / %2$s 个字符。','Which engine translates'=>'哪个引擎负责翻译','No engine is set up yet. Save a key above (or set up an AI model) to start translating.'=>'尚未设置引擎。请在上方保存密钥（或设置 AI 模型）以开始翻译。','Default engine'=>'默认引擎','A different engine per language, automatic fallback and monthly spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'每个语言使用不同的引擎、自动回退以及每月消费上限是 Tranzly Pro 的功能。','Engine for %s'=>'%s 引擎','The default engine'=>'默认引擎','If an engine fails or reaches a limit, try these next, in this order'=>'如果引擎失效或达到限制，请按以下顺序依次尝试：','Monthly spending caps'=>'每月消费上限','When an engine reaches its cap, nothing more is sent to it until next month and the failed-translation report says why. Leave empty for no cap.'=>'当引擎达到其上限时，直到下个月才会向其发送更多内容，且翻译失败报告会说明原因。留空则表示不设上限。','%1$s (spent this month: $%2$s)'=>'%1$s（本月已消费：$%2$s）','Save caps'=>'保存大写字母','Glossary and words never translated'=>'术语表与永不翻译的词汇','Never translate these words (one per line)'=>'永不翻译这些词（每行一个）','Brand and product names stay exactly as they are, with every engine.'=>'品牌和产品名称在所有引擎中都保持原样。','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'首选翻译和每种语言的语调是 Tranzly Pro 的功能。','Preferred translations (one per line: term = translation)'=>'首选翻译（每行一个：术语 = 翻译）','Formality'=>'正式程度','Default'=>'默认','Formal'=>'正式','Informal'=>'非正式','Style instructions (audience, brand voice)'=>'风格说明（受众、品牌语调）','Save glossary'=>'保存词汇表','Job started with %d translations to do. It runs in the background: you can close this page.'=>'任务已开始，共有 %d 个翻译待处理。任务在后台运行，您可以关闭此页面。','Queued again.'=>'已重新加入队列。','Running'=>'运行中','Finished'=>'已完成','Cancelled'=>'已取消','Translate in the background'=>'在后台翻译','Set up a translation engine in the Engines tab first.'=>'请先在“引擎”标签页中设置翻译引擎。','Translate every'=>'全部翻译','Into'=>'导入','With'=>'带有','Each language’s own engine'=>'每种语言专属的引擎','Publish the translations (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'发布翻译（否则它们将另存为草稿）','Estimate the cost'=>'估算费用','%1$d posts, %2$s characters. The price for this engine is not known in advance.'=>'%1$d 篇帖子，%2$s 个字符。此引擎的价格未知。','%1$d posts, %2$s characters: about $%3$s on your own account.'=>'%1$d 篇文章，%2$s 个字符：您的账户大约需要 $%3$s。','Start translating'=>'开始翻译','Jobs'=>'任务','No translation jobs yet.'=>'暂无翻译任务。','Job %1$d — %2$s'=>'作业 %1$d — %2$s','%1$d of %2$d translated, %3$d failed, %4$d skipped (protected or already in that language)'=>'已翻译 %1$d / %2$d，失败 %3$d，已跳过 %4$d（受保护或已是该语言）','Stop this job'=>'停止此作业','See what failed and why'=>'查看失败的项目及原因','Content'=>'内容','Language'=>'语言','What went wrong'=>'哪里出错了','Fix it'=>'修复','Details'=>'详细信息','Retry with'=>'重试：','The same engine'=>'同一引擎','Retry'=>'重试','Translate by hand'=>'手动翻译','Languages and settings'=>'语言与设置','Engines'=>'引擎','Translation jobs'=>'翻译任务','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'在管理菜单的 Tranzly 下添加第二种语言，切换器就会显示在这里。','Switcher'=>'切换器','Accessible label'=>'辅助功能标签','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'语言切换器','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'指向该网站各个语言版本的此页链接。在列出两个或更多语言之前，它不呈现任何内容。','block keywordlanguage'=>'语言','block keywordswitcher'=>'切换器','block keywordtranslation'=>'翻译']];